  "name": "Chicken Breasts Stuffed with Crabmeat",
  "subtitle": "Crab-filled chicken with a crisp breadcrumb coating",
  "description": "Chicken breasts are filled with seasoned crab and cream cheese, coated in flour, egg, and breadcrumbs, then cooked until golden and safely done.",
